      "title": "What the loop guarantees",
      "items": [
        "Ten SSE steps, discovery through preview_synced",
        "Tenant schema and edge functions share one host",
        "File push retries three times on transport failure",
        "Build gate rolls src/ back rather than promote broken code"
      ]
