    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Where it stays silent",
      "items": [
        "Credential sync is best-effort, never blocks the push",
        "A 401 leaves the app booting with no database",
        ".env.local is replaced wholesale, not merged",
        "eCG routes take no agent lock while writing files"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What only the gate catches",
      "items": [
        "esbuild checks syntax, not types or imports",
        "typeCheckProject runs after the response, advisory only",
        "A missing import compiles and ships",
        "Rollback reports promoted: false, not an error"
